---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PhotoPile from '../components/scenes/PhotoPile.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Beyond work"
  description="Shivam Birmole outside work: travel, mostly solo, photography and fitness."
>
  <header class="page-head">
    <h1>Away from the laptop I am usually somewhere unfamiliar.</h1>
  </header>

  <PhotoPile />

  <div class="beyond-text">
    <p>
      I travel when I can, and mostly on my own. 15+ countries so far. Going alone means every plan is mine to
      make and mine to fix, and I like that.
    </p>
    <p>I take a camera, and I say yes to whatever the place offers. Some days that is a scooter. Some days it is a rope.</p>
  </div>

  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="rest-title">
    <h2 id="rest-title">The rest of the week.</h2>
    <div class="beyond-text">
      <p>
        I train, and I photograph things that are not work. Neither has a number attached and neither needs one.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
